WEBVTT

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:09.090
<b>It's not easy when a lot of
different things are important to you.</b>

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:16.640
<b>To get one thing sometimes
you have to let go of another.</b>

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.020
<b>But the heart is the most important of all.</b>

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:26.970
Unyielding wish that rises in my chest

