00:01:58.490 --> 00:01:59.740
<b>What the...?</b>

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:02.450
<b>That's fine.</b>

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:04.700
<b>Just take care of Ren.</b>

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.330
<b>Iron Maiden...</b>

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:10.920
<b>I will do as you ask.</b>

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:16.010
<b>But I have nothing more to say
to someone as impure as you.</b>

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.380
<b>Now go.</b>

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:20.680
<b>Asakura Yoh</b>

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:27.480
<b>You idiot, what is your game here?</b>

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:33.020
<b>You fought your way here because
you wanted to be Shaman King.</b>

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:36.320
<b>How can you withdraw that easily?</b>

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:39.150
<b>This has to be a trick.</b>

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:40.880
<b>Don't underestimate him.</b>

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:44.620
<b>Boss Yoh is fighting for
the things he cares about.</b>

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:47.830
<b>You said you'd heal him, so do it.</b>

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.040
<b>Because if Ren dies, I'll waste you.</b>

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:57.210
<b>It may be hard for you to understand.</b>

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.680
<b>You may know the sorrow of loss...</b>

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:04.680
<b>But you don't know how to love.</b>

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:07.850
<b>That may be true.</b>

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:13.400
<b>Yoh-kun really wanted to be Shaman King.</b>

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:18.860
<b>But I'm not sure I could've respected
him if he'd turned his back on Ren-kun.</b>

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:21.240
<b>I'm proud...</b>

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.240
<b>To have a friend like him.</b>

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.240
<b>Yoh-dono...</b>

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.370
<b>It was a noble sacrifice.</b>

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:35.920
<b>Yoh-kun...</b>

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.260
<b>Asakura Yoh...!</b>

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.220
<b>Please hurry.</b>

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:51.310
<b>And so, Yoh-kun's quest to be
the Shaman King came to an end.</b>

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:59.360
<b>But life goes on, the contestants of the Shaman
Fight carry their hopes and dreams into battle.</b>

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.820
<b>There are lots of people in the world
and they all have their own unique goals.</b>

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.600
<b>The dreams of some clash
resulting in laughter and tears.</b>

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:14.420
<b>How many of us will make
our dreams come true?</b>

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:20.760
<b>And how many of those realized
dreams will actually bring us happiness?</b>

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:25.760
<b>No one knows.</b>

