00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:19.730
<b>Go to the hallowed ground of
Osorezan and meet this unknown Fiancée.</b>

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:25.110
<b>What, who's cat is this?!</b>

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:26.520
<b>He's a ghost, Yoh-sama!</b>

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:29.030
<b>And he's not just any animal spirit!</b>

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:30.990
<b>Forgive me.</b>

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:36.580
<b>I come on important
business, but I abhor bedlam.</b>

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:40.160
<b>Yoh-san, I wish to speak to you.</b>

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:43.880
<b>Can you quiet the cacophony?</b>

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:48.920
<b>These vulgar spirits make my head hurt.</b>

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:50.760
<b>What did you call us?!</b>

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:53.890
<b>Who do you think you are?!</b>

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:56.140
<b>We've been dead for 400 years!</b>

00:07:56.220 --> 00:08:00.770
<b>We're a noble fox and raccoon dog, and
we ascended to spirithood a long time ago!</b>

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:05.810
<b>You talk big for a lousy alley cat!</b>

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:10.400
<b>Show some respect for your elders!</b>

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.780
<b>Put on some pants.</b>

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:15.200
<b>They chafe!</b>

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:19.240
<b>The weak like to bear their fangs...</b>

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:26.460
<b>I don't like conflict, but a display
of power is at times necessary.</b>

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.090
<b>Shall we fight?</b>

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.880
<b>Let's go!</b>

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:35.340
<b>Forgive me.</b>

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:40.680
<b>I failed to mention that I've served
the house of Asakura for ten centuries.</b>

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:46.480
<b>I've just returned from my travel abroad
to accompany Yoh-san on his journey.</b>

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:49.400
<b>I am Matamune, the split-tailed cat.</b>

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:52.740
<b>Split...
Tailed...</b>

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.700
<b>My favorite thing is catnip.</b>

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:59.240
<b>I am honored to make your acquaintance.</b>

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.330
<b>Uh.. Okay...</b>

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.330
<b>Matamune the split-tailed cat...</b>

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:09.090
<b>I wasn't sure what was going on...</b>

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:16.720
<b>But this amazing cat had been with
the Asakura family for a thousand years.</b>

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:20.680
<b>Grandpa had summoned him.</b>

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:23.890
<b>He was an odd ghost
who liked to read books.</b>

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:31.570
<b>And, as might be expected after a
thousand years, he had some amazing powers.</b>

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:34.360
<b>He even got Ponchi and
Conchi to wear diapers.</b>

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:37.490
<b>And he...</b>

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:40.450
<b>was my first spirit ally.</b>

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:45.000
<b>Of course, it was in name only...</b>

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:48.830
<b>I was in no position
to tell him what to do.</b>

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:58.630
<b>Hahaha, this is amazing Matamune!</b>

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:01.680
<b>A sleeper train
from Ueno to Hokkaido</b>

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.010
<b>It's the Otsutosei.</b>

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:07.270
<b>There's even a lobby car
and a dining car, how cool!</b>

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:12.480
<b>We got a deluxe room,
Grandpa really splurged!</b>

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.780
<b>Yoh-san, you're
surprisingly fond of trains.</b>

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.610
<b>Yeah, I am!</b>

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:21.320
<b>I like everything about them,
their shape, their power...</b>

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:24.740
<b>and the big bulky chassis
they have these days</b>

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:26.950
<b>Are you friendless?</b>

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.670
<b>Forgive my impertinence...</b>

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:34.670
<b>I just had a feeling.</b>

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:38.220
<b>You don't have any friends, do you?</b>

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:42.390
<b>Not really.</b>

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:47.480
<b>I have grandpa, mom and Tamao at home...</b>

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.980
<b>But I guess they don't count.</b>

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:53.730
<b>I don't want to blame it on my powers...</b>

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:58.440
<b>But there's nobody at
school I can really talk to.</b>

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:02.950
<b>When I tell people what I
do, they think I'm a freak.</b>

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:07.660
<b>But if I don't tell them,
I feel like I’m living a lie.</b>

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:11.250
<b>I want to change that.</b>

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:15.170
<b>So I've decided to be the Shaman King</b>

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:17.420
<b>Yoh-san...</b>

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:19.970
<b>but maybe it's just an excuse...</b>

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:23.260
<b>Maybe I'm just not good at making friends.</b>

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:28.390
<b>And now I have to go meet my fiancée
and I have no idea what to say to her.</b>

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:32.230
<b>I'm getting nervous just thinking about it.</b>

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:36.110
<b>It's late.</b>

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:38.280
<b>You should go to bed.</b>

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:40.950
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:48.370
<b><i>The one who awaits you
will never let you feel lonely.</i></b>

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.670
<b><i>Know this at least.</i></b>

