that are better left forgotten.</b>

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.260
<b>But Yoh-san...</b>

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:43.470
<b>There are some things you must learn.</b>

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:50.360
<b>Always let your heart choose your path.</b>

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:57.320
<b>This is sincere advice from one who fought
in the last Shaman Fight 500 years ago.</b>

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:05.910
<b>I shall go ahead and pay
my respects to Kino-san.</b>

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:07.870
<b>Huh? Wait what are you..?</b>

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:09.420
<b>Excuse me.</b>

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:11.750
<b>Wait, Matamune!</b>

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:13.500
<b>Matamune!</b>

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:29.020
<b>You're blocking traffic, die.</b>

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:38.030
<b>The one who awaits you
will never let you feel lonely.</b>

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:40.750
<b>Know this at least</b>

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:41.990
<b>Know this at least</b>

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:46.790
<b>Wait, hold it right there!</b>

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:56.090
<b>Don't try to get chummy
with me, I'll kill you.</b>

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:58.630
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:01.300
<b>Hmph, what a pathetic man.</b>

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:06.140
<b>Asakura Yoh, he's
supposed to be my husband?</b>

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:09.230
<b>Huh?</b>

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:14.220
<b>INN</b>

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:14.150
<b>What a surprise, I had
no idea you were coming.</b>

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:16.110
<b>Matamune.</b>

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:19.780
<b>Forgive me for not
keeping in touch, Kino-san.</b>

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:24.490
<b>Don't just stand there, come in.</b>

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:28.610
Tamaki

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:28.450
<b>Ah, the memories.</b>

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:31.710
<b>This place hasn't changed one bit.</b>

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:36.040
<b>You must be very sentimental, Kino-san.</b>

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:40.090
<b>I just don't have the
money to remodel this dump.</b>

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:42.590
<b>Don't be so nosy.</b>

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:48.270
<b>The years haven't dulled
the sharpness of your tongue</b>

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:52.100
<b>Nor have they made
you any less annoying!</b>

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:55.440
<b>What cheek you have for a cat!</b>

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:58.860
<b>Is this what happens to
ghosts after a thousand years?</b>

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:03.280
<b>Well, remember who
my former owner was.</b>

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:06.450
<b>Matamune...</b>

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:07.700
<b>Yeah?</b>

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.700
<b>You have great power.</b>

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:13.370
<b>Out of all the Asakura spirits...</b>

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:18.880
<b>Yohmei chose you and you
probably already know why.</b>

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:22.880
<b>Is her condition serious?</b>

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:25.220
<b>Yes.</b>

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:29.180
<b>The girl is cursed.</b>

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:33.730
<b>By her birth, by her
powers and by fate.</b>

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:37.480
<b>Even you may not come
through this unscathed.</b>

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:42.490
<b>Anna is a force to
be reckoned with.</b>

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:50.490
<b>That was scary.</b>

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:54.620
<b>She called my name and
I freaked out and ran away.</b>

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:57.130
<b>Why would she threaten to kill me?</b>

00:20:58.130 --> 00:20:59.170
<b>Asakura Yoh...</b>

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:01.670
<b>He's supposed to be my husband?</b>

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:08.510
<b>So that was my fiancée?</b>

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:11.100
<b><i>My fiancée...</i></b>

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:13.270
<b><i>Well, she is kinda cute.</i></b>

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:15.810
<b>Die.</b>

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:20.110
<b>I'm so clueless</b>

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:22.230
<b>Are all girls like that?</b>

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:26.490
<b>I've never talked to the
girls at school.</b>

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:29.120
<b>And now I'm totally lost, aren't I?</b>

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:40.340
<b>Die.</b>

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:43.960
<b>Another death threat!</b>

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:48.510
<b>What the hell is that thing?
I've never seen a ghost like this!</b>

00:21:49.180 --> 00:21:50.470
<b>Leaf sprites!</b>

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.100
<b>I'm stronger than I used to be!</b>

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:56.730
<b>Go for it!
Power Strike!</b>

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:04.690
<b>What the hell, why me?!</b>

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.950
<b>What did I do to deserve this?!</b>

00:22:10.030 --> 00:22:12.700
<b>Ah, Yoh-san, there you are.</b>

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:13.830
<b>Matamune!</b>

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:16.550
<b>You took a long time,
so I came looking for you.</b>

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:18.460
<b>What the hell is that thing?</b>

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:20.170
<b>That's a demon.</b>

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:21.080
<b>Demon?!</b>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:23.750
<b>They show up now and then.</b>

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:27.340
<b>They are lost souls filled with
resentment and regret...</b>

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:31.090
<b>These feelings fester and
grow more terrible with time.</b>

00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:34.350
<b>Eventually they take
material form and strike out.</b>

00:22:35.060 --> 00:22:36.480
<b>We call them demons.</b>

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:42.770
<b>Though of little consequence,
sadly, it must be slain.</b>

00:22:43.020 --> 00:22:43.690
<b>Matamune!</b>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:56.950
<b>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu: Shamanic soul pacification!</b>

00:22:58.120 --> 00:22:59.410
<b>Vanquish!</b>

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:06.380
<b><i>Matamune, the split-tailed cat.</i></b>

00:23:07.460 --> 00:23:12.220
<b><i>He used his pipe as a
medium to make an Over Soul.</i></b>

00:23:13.630 --> 00:23:17.770
<b><i>Of course, I didn't know
much about this stuff back then...</i></b>

00:23:18.720 --> 00:23:21.140
<b><i>About ghosts that have
their own Over Souls...</i></b>

00:23:21.850 --> 00:23:23.060
<b><i>Or demons...</i></b>

00:23:24.110 --> 00:23:26.230
<b><i>Or fiancees.</i></b>

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:30.490
<b><i>Abandoned on the street desolate...</i></b>

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:34.280
<b><i>Sulking in shadows feeling
the weight of the world...</i></b>

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:39.580
<b><i>Love is hellos,
goodbyes and gossamer.</i></b>

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:44.460
<b>Osorezan Le Voile</b>

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:50.950
<b>Osorezan Le Voile Part 2</b>

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:50.950
<b>Osorezan Le Voile Part 2</b>

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:50.720
<b>Next time: "Osorezan Le Voile Part 2"</b>

00:23:47.720 --> 00:23:50.950
